{"id":"ahora","lemma":"ahora","pos":"adv","rank":41,"glosses":["now (at the present time)","just now, just a moment ago (in the past)","very soon, in a moment (in the future)"],"ipa":"/aˈoɾa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ahora.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vete a casa, ahora.","en":"Go home now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78163"},{"text":"Yo lo siento ahora.","en":"I feel it now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440276"},{"text":"Ahora tengo que irme.","en":"I must go now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440217"},{"text":"Tengo que irme ahora.","en":"I must go now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440222"},{"text":"Yo lo necesito ahora.","en":"I need it now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440352"}]}